sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client App
    participant G as API Gateway
    participant U as User Service
    participant R as Report Service
    participant DB as Database

    Note over C,DB: Authentication & Authorization Flow

    C->>G: 1. Login Request (credentials)
    G->>U: 2. Validate Credentials
    U->>DB: 3. Query User & Roles
    DB-->>U: 4. User Data & Permissions
    U-->>G: 5. User Context + JWT
    G-->>C: 6. JWT Token

    Note over C,DB: API Request with RBAC

    C->>G: 7. API Request + JWT
    G->>G: 8. Validate JWT
    G->>U: 9. Get Current Permissions (cached)
    U-->>G: 10. User Roles & Permissions
    G->>R: 11. Forward Request + User Context
    Note right of G: Headers: X-User-ID, X-User-Roles, X-User-Permissions
    R->>R: 12. Check RBAC for Report Type
    alt Permission Granted
        R->>DB: 13. Generate Report
        DB-->>R: 14. Report Data
        R-->>G: 15. Report Response
        G-->>C: 16. Success Response
    else Permission Denied
        R-->>G: 17. 403 Forbidden
        G-->>C: 18. Access Denied
    end

    Note over C,DB: Role-Based Report Access Examples
    Note over R: Operator: Vehicle Logs Only
    Note over R: Manager: All Site Reports
    Note over R: Admin: System-wide Access